                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.00/5904: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Eberhardt</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-08-10T10:00:00-05:45"><hi rendition="#italic">August 10,
                                1928—10 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 2:15
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>306. Medrano, candidate Vice Presidency, has resigned on account of serious
                    illness.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Eberhardt</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
